From: Peios Package Maintainers <packages@peios.dev>
Subject: [PATCH] clang: accept Peios triplet resource directory in driver test

Peios installs target-specific libraries and Clang resources beneath the
x86_64-linux-peios multiarch directory.  Keep the upstream lib/lib64 cases
while teaching the DriverKit test about that intentional layout.

---
 clang/test/Driver/driverkit-path.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/clang/test/Driver/driverkit-path.c b/clang/test/Driver/driverkit-path.c
index a6ef5f22f7d8..1d184be0b2c1 100644
--- a/clang/test/Driver/driverkit-path.c
+++ b/clang/test/Driver/driverkit-path.c
@@ -29,5 +29,5 @@ int main() { return 0; }
 // INC-LABEL: #include <...> search starts here:
 // INC:       [[PATH]]/System/DriverKit/usr/local/include
-// INC:       /lib{{(64)?}}/clang/{{[^/ ]+}}/include
+// INC:       /lib{{(64|/x86_64-linux-peios)?}}/clang/{{[^/ ]+}}/include
 // INC:       [[PATH]]/System/DriverKit/usr/include
 // INC:       [[PATH]]/System/DriverKit/System/Library/Frameworks (framework directory)
-- 
2.51.0
